WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:03.200
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.701
We hope you're doing well,
and now we are gonna

00:00:04.701 --> 00:00:06.234
get to the news.
President Biden today spoke with

00:00:06.234 --> 00:00:09.801
allies and partners
about the situation in Ukraine.

00:00:09.801 --> 00:00:11.901
Next he'll speak with
Republicans.

00:00:11.901 --> 00:00:13.234
[ Laughter ]

00:00:13.234 --> 00:00:16.133
After the U.S. offered
over the weekend to evacuate

00:00:16.133 --> 00:00:18.868
Ukrainian President Volodymyr
Zelenskyy -- excuse me --

00:00:18.868 --> 00:00:21.467
amid the Russian invasion,
Zelenskyy reportedly said,

00:00:21.467 --> 00:00:24.634
"The fight is here.
I need ammunition, not a ride."

00:00:24.634 --> 00:00:27.834
Oh, man, how badly does Biden
wish that quote was his?

00:00:27.834 --> 00:00:29.834
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.834 --> 00:00:33.367
It's like Zelenskyy said, "Come
with me if you want to live."

00:00:33.367 --> 00:00:34.567
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:37.167
If Zelenskyy gets to fight
on top of a train,

00:00:37.167 --> 00:00:39.434
he's officially living
Biden's best life.

00:00:39.434 --> 00:00:40.367
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.367 --> 00:00:42.334
"I'm the Amtrak guy!"

00:00:42.334 --> 00:00:44.934
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.934 --> 00:00:47.534
During his keynote speech
on Saturday at CPAC,

00:00:47.534 --> 00:00:50.200
former President Trump said that
the country has

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:52.434
"lost its self-confidence
under President Biden."

00:00:52.434 --> 00:00:53.667
Well, of course.

00:00:53.667 --> 00:00:56.067
We all had more self-confidence
under you.

00:00:56.067 --> 00:00:57.734
Do you know how affirming it is

00:00:57.734 --> 00:01:00.067
to be smarter
than the president?

00:01:00.067 --> 00:01:01.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.467 --> 00:01:05.067
Waking up every day with a jump
in my step.

00:01:05.067 --> 00:01:07.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:08.667
In his soon-to-be-released book,

00:01:08.667 --> 00:01:11.067
former President Trump's
attorney general William Barr

00:01:11.067 --> 00:01:14.567
said, "Trump cared only about
one thing -- himself.

00:01:14.567 --> 00:01:16.968
Country and principle
took second place."

00:01:16.968 --> 00:01:18.834
I don't know, dude. Second?

00:01:18.834 --> 00:01:20.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:22.033
I think country took fifth place

00:01:22.033 --> 00:01:24.534
and principle broke its leg
and had to be shot.

00:01:24.534 --> 00:01:25.968
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.968 --> 00:01:28.767
"We can't save principle."

00:01:28.767 --> 00:01:31.234
In the same book, Barr
criticized Trump and said,

00:01:31.234 --> 00:01:33.801
"People are worthwhile to Trump
only as a means

00:01:33.801 --> 00:01:35.701
to his ends as utensils."

00:01:35.701 --> 00:01:37.133
Said Trump, "That's a lie.

00:01:37.133 --> 00:01:38.901
I've never used a utensil
in my life."

00:01:38.901 --> 00:01:40.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.834 --> 00:01:42.634
Ahead of tomorrow's
State of the Union address,

00:01:42.634 --> 00:01:44.934
House Speaker Nancy Pelosi
is lifting the chamber's

00:01:44.934 --> 00:01:48.067
mask mandate, which is
concerning to many House members

00:01:48.067 --> 00:01:49.767
who still need them
for attention.

00:01:49.767 --> 00:01:52.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:55.334
A Ukrainian brewery
has reportedly switched

00:01:55.334 --> 00:01:58.534
from producing craft beers to
making Molotov cocktails

00:01:58.534 --> 00:02:00.367
to help fight
the Russian military.

00:02:00.367 --> 00:02:02.200
Though, if you really want to
slow down the Russians,

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:04.033
just give them the craft beer.

00:02:04.033 --> 00:02:05.100
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:08.300
"Oh, I felt like I ate
a loaf of bread."

00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:10.033
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.033 --> 00:02:13.100
"Pumpernickel?"
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:15.734
Lawmakers in Florida last week
passed the so-called

00:02:15.734 --> 00:02:18.634
"don't say gay" bill, which
prohibits classroom discussions

00:02:18.634 --> 00:02:20.901
about sexual orientation
or gender identity.

00:02:20.901 --> 00:02:22.767
Pretty soon,
a Florida school day

00:02:22.767 --> 00:02:25.267
is just going to be seven hours
of quiet time.

00:02:25.267 --> 00:02:28.033
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:28.033 --> 00:02:30.968
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.968 --> 00:02:33.801
Nothing more ironic than
when the "quiet time" punch line

00:02:33.801 --> 00:02:36.234
gets the quietest response.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.234 --> 00:02:37.767
Maybe they were honoring it.

00:02:37.767 --> 00:02:41.834
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.834 --> 00:02:44.133
New York Mayor Eric Adams
announced yesterday that

00:02:44.133 --> 00:02:45.868
beginning next week,
the city will no longer

00:02:45.868 --> 00:02:48.033
require vaccine passports
at restaurants,

00:02:48.033 --> 00:02:50.701
which is great news for all the
restaurants who already stopped

00:02:50.701 --> 00:02:52.133
checking them three weeks ago.

00:02:52.133 --> 00:02:53.501
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.501 --> 00:02:56.567
And finally, a dog house
that was struck by a meteorite

00:02:56.567 --> 00:02:59.000
sold last week for $44,000.

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:01.133
Even crazier, it sold on Zillow.

00:03:01.133 --> 00:03:02.701
[ Laughter ]

00:03:02.701 --> 00:03:04.801
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

